@host = http://localhost:5203
@token = paste-the-accessToken-here

### Login as administrator
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@supermarket.local", "password": "<Seed:AdminPassword>" }

### Register (always creates an Employee)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Perez", "email": "ana@supermarket.local", "password": "Secret123" }

### List products
GET {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create product (administrator)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Cafe Molido", "brand": "Juan Valdez", "category": "Bebidas", "unitType": "Weight", "unitValue": 0.5, "cost": 8000, "salePrice": 11000 }

### List inventory (low stock)
GET {{host}}/api/inventory?lowStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a batch (administrator)
POST {{host}}/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "paste-product-id", "batchNumber": "L001", "location": "A-01", "quantity": 20, "minimumStock": 5, "receivedDate": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z", "expirationDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z" }

### Restock a batch (administrator)
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/paste-stock-id/add-quantity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 10 }

### Create sale (price, lot and user are decided by the backend)
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": "paste-product-id", "quantity": 15 } ] }

### My sales
GET {{host}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create task
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Revisar lotes por vencer", "description": "Bodega A", "dueDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z" }

### Move a task forward (Pending -> InProgress -> Completed)
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/paste-task-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Revisar lotes por vencer", "description": "Bodega A", "dueDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "status": "InProgress" }
